WEBVTT

00:00:02.910 --> 00:00:05.970
It was an era when a man lived as a warrior...

00:00:06.110 --> 00:00:10.780
He fought, staking his life on
his faith in the sword...

00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:14.610
The final era... the Bakumatsu.

00:00:24.760 --> 00:00:29.000
Intrigue in the Bakumatsu

00:00:43.220 --> 00:00:46.850
Tsukikage kooru daichi wo

00:00:46.850 --> 00:00:50.690
Korogari fumiwakete yuku

00:00:50.690 --> 00:00:57.900
Horobi to saisei no jidai ga hajimaru

00:00:57.900 --> 00:01:01.570
Jiyuu wo omoku kakagete

00:01:01.570 --> 00:01:05.170
Michinaki michi wo erande

00:01:05.170 --> 00:01:12.240
Mahiru yori mabushii nichibotsu wo koete

00:01:12.240 --> 00:01:19.250
Yume wo kataru you ni toki no fune wa yuku

00:01:19.250 --> 00:01:28.350
Sono yamiji no mukou ni atarashii yoake

00:01:29.130 --> 00:01:36.270
Bokura wa kitto kurayami no kaina kara umarete kita

00:01:36.270 --> 00:01:39.810
Kanawanu koi wo suruyou ni

00:01:39.810 --> 00:01:43.780
Hikari e to samayotteku

00:01:43.780 --> 00:01:49.050
Doko made mo hateshino nai kono michi wo

00:01:49.050 --> 00:01:54.490
Kaeru sube wa nai

00:02:45.700 --> 00:02:48.970
Why not? Why not?

00:02:49.170 --> 00:02:52.840
Why not let the world change?

00:02:52.840 --> 00:02:56.180
Why not? Why not?

00:02:56.180 --> 00:02:59.480
Why not let the world change?

00:02:59.750 --> 00:03:02.790
Why not? Why not?

00:03:02.790 --> 00:03:06.090
Why not let the world change?

00:03:06.690 --> 00:03:08.430
Why not? Why not?

00:03:08.430 --> 00:03:12.230
Large-scale public disturbances such as these,

00:03:12.360 --> 00:03:17.960
exploding everywhere throughout that year,
particularly in the Tokai, Kinki and Shikoku areas

00:03:18.070 --> 00:03:21.370
were called Why Not Phenomenon.

00:03:21.570 --> 00:03:23.910
There are a number of theories
to explain its cause,

00:03:24.040 --> 00:03:27.310
including one suggesting that it was triggered
by a large number of amulets from Ise Shrine,

00:03:27.410 --> 00:03:33.820
distributed by the pro-Imperial faction
hoping to disturb the state of society.

00:03:50.300 --> 00:03:55.710
One, the master of the Edo forces, and the other,
who leads his forces under the Imperial flag.

00:03:57.240 --> 00:04:01.910
Lock horns as much as you desire!

00:04:02.410 --> 00:04:03.540
Come on!

00:04:03.780 --> 00:04:05.510
Come on, come on, come on!

00:04:05.720 --> 00:04:06.680
Come on!

00:04:06.990 --> 00:04:08.150
Why you!

00:04:09.250 --> 00:04:10.350
Stop messing with me!

00:04:15.490 --> 00:04:20.590
Entertainment like this isn't
something you can see every day.

00:04:20.900 --> 00:04:26.270
It is pointless to interrupt. So enjoy it with me.

00:04:27.740 --> 00:04:29.910
Damn it! What have you done to me?

00:04:29.910 --> 00:04:31.000
My arms!

00:04:35.180 --> 00:04:36.170
Hrm...

00:04:47.090 --> 00:04:50.390
Why not let the world change?

00:05:19.460 --> 00:05:20.250
Let's go.

00:05:28.570 --> 00:05:30.090
Y-You...

00:05:30.900 --> 00:05:31.770
Who are you?

00:05:32.100 --> 00:05:32.800
What do we do?

00:05:32.800 --> 00:05:34.140
Why ask me?
What do we do?

00:05:34.670 --> 00:05:36.800
We have no choice but to do it, don't we?

00:05:39.610 --> 00:05:40.370
Hurry!

00:06:14.850 --> 00:06:15.870
This is...

00:06:20.320 --> 00:06:21.680
Is it going to make a move?

00:06:22.850 --> 00:06:24.220
Hey, you!

00:06:24.920 --> 00:06:25.950
Intruders!

00:06:27.530 --> 00:06:28.860
You bastards!

00:06:34.870 --> 00:06:35.570
Intruders!

00:06:35.570 --> 00:06:36.560
I've got this!

00:06:40.540 --> 00:06:43.770
There are just too many rooms
and no reason for them.

00:06:44.080 --> 00:06:48.100
I'd be lost inside a samurai's house.

00:06:48.410 --> 00:06:51.040
And you talk too much for no reason, too.

00:06:51.420 --> 00:06:52.640
I'll go ahead.

00:06:53.520 --> 00:06:56.320
Sorry about that.

00:07:18.110 --> 00:07:22.050
So what? So what? To hell with Tokugawa!

00:07:22.250 --> 00:07:24.750
At the end of the day he's still a rookie in Edo!

00:07:24.750 --> 00:07:28.920
Basically, he's nothing but
a country samurai from Mikawa!

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:30.410
K-Katsu-sensei!

00:07:30.790 --> 00:07:35.730
Exiled and called back...
Exiled and called back...

00:07:36.060 --> 00:07:40.790
Shimazu took care of me, but
I bear a grudge against him, too...

00:07:40.970 --> 00:07:42.960
S-Saigo-dono?

00:07:43.100 --> 00:07:46.140
I see his true feelings came out.

00:07:46.140 --> 00:07:48.610
That's not true! Katsu isn't being himself!

00:07:48.610 --> 00:07:51.270
S-something has taken over them!

00:08:11.000 --> 00:08:12.430
So we meet again.

00:08:12.760 --> 00:08:15.670
Move out of the way.
I have no business with you.

00:08:15.670 --> 00:08:16.790
We're in a hurry!

00:08:35.350 --> 00:08:36.450
Akizuki-sama!

00:08:37.360 --> 00:08:38.490
Let me handle it!

00:08:38.490 --> 00:08:39.290
But!

00:08:39.290 --> 00:08:40.810
Just go!

00:08:41.290 --> 00:08:42.260
Let's go!

00:08:43.290 --> 00:08:44.730
Leader! Hurry!

00:08:59.510 --> 00:09:02.270
No way out. Checkmate.

00:09:18.330 --> 00:09:20.460
It's being indecisive!

00:09:21.700 --> 00:09:25.270
That's also a part of fun. Be indecisive!

00:09:25.270 --> 00:09:28.940
Which one of you will attain the power
of the Head and rule the world?

00:09:28.940 --> 00:09:31.370
Be very indecisive!

00:09:31.480 --> 00:09:32.700
Saigo-dono!

00:09:33.310 --> 00:09:35.040
Master, snap out of it!

00:09:36.580 --> 00:09:39.240
If I were to rule...

00:09:44.390 --> 00:09:47.550
I'm the true...

00:09:59.240 --> 00:10:01.000
This must be the servants' room.

00:10:08.610 --> 00:10:10.740
Where? Where are they?

00:10:13.920 --> 00:10:15.940
Where is he?

00:11:26.920 --> 00:11:30.490
Shinza, didn't I say we should let him handle it?

00:11:31.700 --> 00:11:33.000
Let Yojiro handle it.

00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:36.160
But it was me... I'm the one who let that man...

00:11:37.670 --> 00:11:42.200
If you're not going to do it, why don't I do it?

00:11:42.370 --> 00:11:42.960
What?

00:11:43.370 --> 00:11:45.240
Cooking.

00:11:45.680 --> 00:11:48.540
It's fun, too.

00:11:53.250 --> 00:11:56.020
Bamboo shoots are growing well this year.

00:11:56.620 --> 00:11:59.490
Why don't I make a soup with it?

00:12:39.060 --> 00:12:43.800
Look what's beneath the surface
of the great patriots...

00:13:55.670 --> 00:13:59.870
To hell with Tokugawa! To hell with the
Edo Bureau of Military Affairs!

00:14:00.110 --> 00:14:04.100
Who cares about Satsuma!
I don't need the Nishiki flag!

00:14:05.920 --> 00:14:10.410
The only one who moves this
world is me! Only me!

00:14:12.260 --> 00:14:14.520
No, that's me!

00:14:15.130 --> 00:14:16.690
Please wake up!

00:14:16.690 --> 00:14:18.660
It's over!

00:14:18.860 --> 00:14:20.530
Well, well...

00:14:20.530 --> 00:14:27.200
Let's see which of you will bring chaos and
calamity to this world with the power of the Head!

00:14:27.470 --> 00:14:30.240
The time has come! Now let us see it!

00:14:30.240 --> 00:14:34.940
Let us hear it! Your desire!

00:15:42.480 --> 00:15:43.450
My eye...

00:15:51.690 --> 00:15:52.750
Why you!

00:16:20.120 --> 00:16:21.740
You must be out of bullets now.

00:16:49.380 --> 00:16:50.680
That's the last room.

00:16:50.920 --> 00:16:52.640
What's this smoke?

00:16:56.920 --> 00:16:59.060
Finally!

00:16:59.060 --> 00:17:03.650
Finally the new master of the Head
is going to be chosen!

00:17:20.210 --> 00:17:22.010
It disappeared.

00:17:24.010 --> 00:17:25.950
What was I doing?

00:17:26.250 --> 00:17:29.120
I think I was dreaming...

00:17:31.190 --> 00:17:32.560
What the...

00:17:32.560 --> 00:17:33.850
The intruders are outside!

00:17:39.430 --> 00:17:40.990
He's got the Head!

00:17:44.740 --> 00:17:45.720
I see.

00:17:46.300 --> 00:17:50.030
So this was the script you wrote this time.

00:17:50.270 --> 00:17:51.400
Nakaiya!

00:17:52.110 --> 00:17:53.840
Jubei Nakaiya!

00:17:56.850 --> 00:18:02.180
Who would've thought that I'd run into this
famous performance troupe of Yokohama?

00:18:06.590 --> 00:18:09.890
So now we've got all the actors here!

00:18:10.190 --> 00:18:13.360
I promised that if you bore your grudge on stage
you could have your revenge.

00:18:13.860 --> 00:18:16.390
I think I've followed through
with my promise, Leader.

00:18:16.570 --> 00:18:17.530
Master...

00:18:38.320 --> 00:18:39.620
I won't let you get away!

00:18:40.090 --> 00:18:42.330
The one who brought about the hidden scandal!

00:18:42.330 --> 00:18:43.550
The true objective of our revenge!

00:18:43.660 --> 00:18:45.720
The true Akki Rasetsu!

00:18:46.500 --> 00:18:49.730
You killed my father and mother...

00:18:53.500 --> 00:18:54.700
I'll never forgive you!

00:19:00.980 --> 00:19:02.310
Leader, finish him!

00:19:03.010 --> 00:19:03.980
Yes!

00:19:08.650 --> 00:19:13.250
Don't get me wrong. He's paid me to do this.

00:19:14.760 --> 00:19:15.660
We did it...

00:19:15.760 --> 00:19:16.660
We did it!

00:19:17.130 --> 00:19:19.100
Leader, we don't have time
to be hanging out here!

00:19:19.230 --> 00:19:20.130
Right...

00:19:20.360 --> 00:19:21.490
Intruders!

00:19:23.330 --> 00:19:25.170
Get them! Get them!

00:19:31.510 --> 00:19:33.810
So that was what you were after.

00:19:35.550 --> 00:19:39.920
Didn't you get close to the troupe
for your own mission as well?

00:19:40.320 --> 00:19:41.720
Stand away from the Head.

00:19:44.760 --> 00:19:45.650
I'll kill you!

00:19:47.630 --> 00:19:48.590
Let's see.

00:19:57.470 --> 00:20:02.740
These warriors protect and honor this
feared and shunned Head of the Conqueror,

00:20:02.740 --> 00:20:06.340
which is destined to be
sealed away and discarded.

00:20:06.440 --> 00:20:11.210
They emerged when Jofuku
let it slip from his hands.

00:20:13.480 --> 00:20:15.350
Wait! What are you going to do with the Head?

00:20:41.750 --> 00:20:46.710
I can't believe that a person like this
exists inside me... That's scary!

00:20:46.880 --> 00:20:49.010
I feel the same way.

00:20:49.120 --> 00:20:54.520
I would be lying if I said I didn't want it,
but in the end, it's an evil thing!

00:20:55.890 --> 00:20:57.860
I guess that means I'd better stay away from it.

00:21:02.070 --> 00:21:03.400
At any rate...

00:21:04.770 --> 00:21:08.260
We've witnessed a bottomless darkness.

00:21:10.070 --> 00:21:14.100
In the end, the power of the Head
couldn't control them.

00:21:14.450 --> 00:21:19.820
No, there was a man who resisted it.

00:21:20.280 --> 00:21:25.120
And there was a man who couldn't protect him.

00:21:25.220 --> 00:21:27.190
It's destiny.

00:21:43.540 --> 00:21:46.200
We must not turn this place into a sea of fire.

00:21:46.310 --> 00:21:49.140
Right. I agree.

00:21:50.710 --> 00:21:55.620
A month later, the 11th day of
the fourth month of Keio 4,

00:21:55.620 --> 00:21:58.390
Edo Castle was handed over without bloodshed.

00:21:58.390 --> 00:22:02.350
