00:23:32.970 --> 00:23:48.370
EPISODE 9
THE
BLACK CAT
CRIES

00:23:34.950 --> 00:23:39.290
Toshi... The Vice Chief
has headed north with Otori.

00:23:39.760 --> 00:23:43.390
I heard that Harada has joined with the Shogitai.

00:23:44.130 --> 00:23:48.370
And look at me... the only one who...
I'm so pathetic...

00:23:48.370 --> 00:24:02.570
THE
BLACK CAT
CRIES

00:23:48.370 --> 00:23:49.170
And look at me... the only one who...
I'm so pathetic...

00:23:49.430 --> 00:23:55.110
At least I want to be the one
who decides where I die!

00:23:55.710 --> 00:24:00.440
Don't be a fool! Don't die!
Don't you die, Okita!
